# Demo 2: worker dies after receiving a message but before ACK
# worker-1 is the only consumer when 3 orders are published, so it receives order-0001.
# It is started with --crash-before-ack and exits mid-processing without ACKing.
# worker-2 is started right after; it should receive order-0001 again (redelivered=True).

