orders	2	1	1

===== queue just after worker-1 crashed (consumers back to 1, order-0001 now owned by worker-2) =====
name	messages_ready	messages_unacknowledged	consumers
orders	1	1	1

# System keeps running: restart worker-1 normally and publish order-0004..0007.

